<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 800 400" role="img">
  <title>Word overlap of 7 in both over 9 in either is 0.778 for a near-copy, 0.000 for a reworded question; the scan caught none of five paraphrases, which still lifted the score from 21 to 23 of 30</title>
  <desc>Left, a panel with two word sets for the tickets what am I paying each month right now and what am I paying per month right now: each is only in A, per is only in B, and seven words are in both. Beneath it the sum seven over nine is 0.778 and a reworded question scores 0.000. Right, three bars of the same classifier scored out of 30: 21 with 64 tickets kept by the scan, 22 with all 66, and 23 with 64 plus five paraphrases, then the note that the scan caught none of five and the highest overlap was 0.077 to 0.200.</desc>
  <text x="400" y="44" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="24" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="middle">Words in common, and what the scan saw</text>
  <text x="20" y="76" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="start">a training ticket and an eval ticket</text>
  <rect x="20" y="90" width="396" height="100" rx="12" fill="#F5F8FA" stroke="#C7CDD4" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
  <text x="32" y="112" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#55636F" text-anchor="start">A only</text>
  <rect x="32" y="122" width="56" height="26" rx="6" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#1F6FB2" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
  <text x="60" y="135" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">each</text>
  <text x="404" y="112" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#55636F" text-anchor="end">B only</text>
  <rect x="350" y="122" width="54" height="26" rx="6" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#1F6FB2" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
  <text x="377" y="135" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">per</text>
  <text x="208" y="112" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="middle">in both: 7</text>
  <rect x="122" y="122" width="54" height="26" rx="6" fill="#F4D5E9" stroke="#C42B8C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
  <text x="149" y="135" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">am</text>
  <rect x="178" y="122" width="54" height="26" rx="6" fill="#F4D5E9" stroke="#C42B8C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
  <text x="205" y="135" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">i</text>
  <rect x="234" y="122" width="54" height="26" rx="6" fill="#F4D5E9" stroke="#C42B8C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
  <text x="261" y="135" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">month</text>
  <rect x="290" y="122" width="54" height="26" rx="6" fill="#F4D5E9" stroke="#C42B8C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
  <text x="317" y="135" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">now</text>
  <rect x="122" y="152" width="54" height="26" rx="6" fill="#F4D5E9" stroke="#C42B8C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
  <text x="149" y="165" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">paying</text>
  <rect x="178" y="152" width="54" height="26" rx="6" fill="#F4D5E9" stroke="#C42B8C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
  <text x="205" y="165" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">right</text>
  <rect x="234" y="152" width="54" height="26" rx="6" fill="#F4D5E9" stroke="#C42B8C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
  <text x="261" y="165" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">what</text>
  <text x="20" y="214" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="start">7 in both  /  9 in either  =  0.778</text>
  <text x="20" y="238" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="start">same question, other words:  0 in both  =  0.000</text>
  <text x="20" y="266" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#55636F" text-anchor="start">The scan compares words, not meaning.</text>
  <text x="450" y="76" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="start">three training sets, one classifier</text>
  <text x="450" y="94" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="start">64 kept by the scan</text>
  <rect x="450" y="104" width="210" height="24" rx="4" fill="#D9EAF9" stroke="#1F6FB2" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
  <text x="668" y="116" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central">21/30</text>
  <text x="450" y="134" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="start">all 66, no scan</text>
  <rect x="450" y="144" width="220" height="24" rx="4" fill="#D9EAF9" stroke="#1F6FB2" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
  <text x="678" y="156" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central">22/30</text>
  <text x="450" y="174" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="start">64 + 5 paraphrases</text>
  <rect x="450" y="184" width="230" height="24" rx="4" fill="#D9EAF9" stroke="#1F6FB2" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
  <text x="688" y="196" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central">23/30</text>
  <line x1="450" y1="84" x2="450" y2="236" stroke="#14202B" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
  <text x="450" y="252" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="start">paraphrases the scan caught: 0 of 5</text>
  <text x="450" y="272" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#55636F" text-anchor="start">highest overlap with any eval</text>
  <text x="450" y="288" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#55636F" text-anchor="start">ticket: 0.077 to 0.200</text>
  <rect x="20" y="296" width="760" height="44" rx="8" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#C7CDD4" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-dasharray="6 4"/>
  <text x="400" y="318" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#14202B" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">23 beats 21 only by memory of the paraphrases; it does not mean a better system</text>
  <text x="400" y="372" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#55636F" text-anchor="middle">A threshold on word overlap catches copies; it never saw the five rewordings.</text>
</svg>
